{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 14, "text": "关于中央文革（一九六六年九月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n215)\n关于中央文革\n（一九六六年九月）\n中央有很多部没做多少好事，文革小组却做了不少好事，名声很大。这个部得改一改。\n（摘自周总理九月十九日讲话）\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-94f22dadda205ffa4e50", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-215.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "667484c49ed7f56d886536bc8c3f7315154b5e28050579feb101cab512839a8d", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "81f97b0e6727957baed05f0c703f916a1b8dc0d4057ae6347a737fae3bdc99ef", "text_chars": 140}
